(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Life cycles.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising putting the stages of a life cycle in order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is a life cycle?.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A life cycle shows the stages a living thing goes through, from the start of its life until it makes young of its own.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Frogs and butterflies.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A frog goes from egg to tadpole to froglet to adult frog. A butterfly goes from egg to caterpillar to pupa to adult butterfly.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Plants have life cycles too.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A plant grows from a seed into a seedling, then an adult plant, which makes flowers and new seeds.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Where does a tadpole fit in a frog's life cycle?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A frog's life cycle starts with an egg in water.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A tadpole hatches from the egg and lives in water, breathing with gills.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "So the tadpole comes after the egg and before the froglet.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put a frog's life cycle in order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Start with what the mother frog lays.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The tadpole lives in water and has a tail.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A froglet has legs and a short tail.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "egg → tadpole → froglet → adult frog.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put a butterfly's life cycle in order.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Butterflies lay eggs on leaves.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What hatches out and eats leaves?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The pupa comes just before the adult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "egg → caterpillar → pupa → adult butterfly.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What happens inside a pupa?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The caterpillar's body changes into a butterfly": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The egg hatches": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The butterfly lays eggs": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The caterpillar sleeps for ever": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The pupa comes between caterpillar and butterfly.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Something big changes in there.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "This change is called metamorphosis.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Inside the pupa, the caterpillar's body changes completely into a butterfly.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Why is it called a life CYCLE?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The adult makes young, and the stages begin again": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It goes very fast": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Animals ride bicycles": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It happens only once": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What does an adult frog do?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It lays eggs.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The eggs start the stages again.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Adults make young, so the stages repeat in a circle: a cycle.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which comes straight after a seed in a plant's life cycle?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Seedling": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Flower": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Fruit": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Adult tree": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What grows first when a seed germinates?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It is a very young plant.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Its name has \"seed\" in it.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A seed germinates and grows into a seedling.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What helped you remember the order?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The arrows": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Thinking of real animals": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The word \"cycle\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Every living thing has a life cycle.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Tadpole. a baby frog that lives in water.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Metamorphosis. a big change in body shape.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Seedling. a very young plant.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
